note
; @config runtime TestRuntime

Bindings initialize exposed pointers before child modules execute. Nested bindings use the immediate parent,
and sibling group exposures can supply source addresses. Pointers inherited from a shape can also be bound.
Public exposure types remain independent of storage.
noteEnd

